# 79. Gameplay / View

Основная модель:

```text
Data
 ↓
Runtime
 ↓
View
```

Примеры:

```text
WeaponData
 ↓
WeaponRuntime
 ↓
WeaponView
```

```text
PlayerRuntime
 ↓
PlayerView
```

