Полный pipeline:

```text
Generation Settings
        ↓
Generate New
        ↓
Logical Maze
        ↓
VisualTheme
        ↓
Context Analysis
        ↓
Weighted Visual Selection
        ↓
Saved Visual Assignments
        ↓
